.TH CHEATO\-COLLECT 1 "2026-05-23" "cheatography-collector" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
cheato\-collect \- download Cheatography cheat sheets and merge them into a single PDF
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B cheato\-collect.sh
[\fB\-i\fR \fItargets-file\fR]
[\fB\-o\fR \fIoutfile\fR]
.br
.B cheato\-collect.sh
.B fetch
[\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR]
\fIdownloads/author_sheet-name.pdf\fR
.br
.B cheato\-collect.sh
.B clean
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B cheato\-collect.sh
reads a list of cheat sheet identifiers from a targets file, downloads the
corresponding PDFs from cheatography.com into the
.I downloads/
directory (skipping any already present), and merges them into a single PDF
using
.BR qpdf (1).
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BI \-i " targets-file"
Path to the targets file.
Default:
.IR targets.txt .
.TP
.BI \-o " outfile"
Path for the merged output PDF.
Default:
.IR out/cheat-set.pdf .
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
.B fetch [\-\-dry\-run] \fIdownloads/author_sheet-name.pdf\fR
Download a single cheat sheet PDF.
The filename must follow the convention
.IR author_sheet-name.pdf ,
which is translated to
.IR https://cheatography.com/author/cheat-sheets/sheet-name/pdf/ .
With
.BR \-\-dry\-run ,
print the resolved URL without downloading.
.TP
.B clean
Remove the
.I out/
and
.I downloads/
directories.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I targets.txt
Default targets file.
Each non-blank, non-comment line must be a filename of the form
.IR author_sheet-name.pdf ,
which is treated as a path under
.IR downloads/ .
Lines beginning with
.B #
and blank lines are ignored.
.TP
.I downloads/
Directory where individual PDFs are cached.
.TP
.I out/cheat-set.pdf
Default path for the merged output PDF.
.SH EXAMPLES
Download all sheets listed in
.I targets.txt
and merge into the default output:
.PP
.RS
.EX
cheato\-collect.sh
.EE
.RE
.PP
Use a custom targets file and output path:
.PP
.RS
.EX
cheato\-collect.sh \-i my\-list.txt \-o out/study.pdf
.EE
.RE
.PP
Inspect the URL that would be fetched without downloading:
.PP
.RS
.EX
cheato\-collect.sh fetch \-\-dry\-run downloads/davechild_linux-command-line.pdf
.EE
.RE
.PP
Remove all generated files:
.PP
.RS
.EX
cheato\-collect.sh clean
.EE
.RE
.SH DEPENDENCIES
.BR curl (1),
.BR qpdf (1),
.BR bash (1)\ 4.0+
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
Success.
.TP
.B 1
Missing or empty targets file, unknown option, or download failure.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR curl (1),
.BR qpdf (1)
